sluice agents pack

Parts of _agents/native/ are adapted from Omnigent (https://github.com/omnigent-ai/omnigent),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0):

- _agents/native/paste.py: the message delivery into a TUI composer through tmux
  (omnigent/harnesses/claude_native/bridge.py: inject_user_message, _paste_and_submit,
  _verify_submit_accepted, _restore_occupied_input, _submit_needle, _paste_payload_bytes);
- _agents/native/claude.py, the composer section: reading Claude Code's input box off the pane
  (bridge.py: _is_box_rule, _composer_row, _occupying_surface, _claude_prompt_rendered,
  _history_search_footer_shown, _draft_in_input_box).

The Codex adapter's app-server and remote TUI arrangement follows Omnigent's
omnigent/harnesses/codex_native design. Its WebSocket and JSON-RPC code is specific to sluice.

Each adapted section carries a header naming its source and what was changed.

